{"title":"TEA AND TOUR AT THE LEGISLATIVE ASSEMBLY","startsAt":"2026-10-16T14:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-16T16:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Let's enjoy some tea, crumpets, history, art and culture OCTOBER 16TH at Ontario's Parliament building. We will experience a tour and tea between 2 - 4 o'clock in the afternoon. **THIS EVENT IS BOOKED MONTHS IN ADVANCE, SO PLEASE PURCHASE YOUR TICKET ASAP, FOR THE 2-4 PM SLOT, TO BE SURE YOU GAIN ENTRANCE FOR THIS DAY. PLEASE ARRIVE 15 MINUTES EARLY.**\n\n**WHERE: ONTARIO LEGISLATIVE BUILDING**\n111 Wellesley Street West, just north of University Avenue and College Street\n**COST:** $45.00\n[Find your tour or webinar | Legislative Assembly of Ontario](https://www.ola.org/en/visit-learn/tours)\nFind tea and tour and hit availability. Go to the OCTOBER calendar and the 16TH day is the only day marked in green. Hit this and continue your booking...\n**BUY YOUR TICKET IMMEIDIATELY at this link. When you have booked your seat please submit your RSVP.**\n\nSUBWAY STOP IS QUEEN'S PARK STATION\nYOU MUST ARRIVE 15 MINUTES PRIOR TO THE START OF THE EVENT TO FACILITATE THE SECURITY SCREENING PROCESS.\n\n**YOU MUST PRESENT A PIECE OF GOVERNMENT- ISSUED PHOTO ID** TO ENTER THE BUILDING. ALL VISITORS MUST PASS THROUGH AN AIRPORT-STYLE SECURITY SCREEN TO ENTER THE LEGISLATIVE BUILDING.","venue":{"name":"111 Wellesley St W","address":"111 Wellesley St W, Toronto","lat":43.663143,"lng":-79.391914,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Seniors Social Club","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/a/a/3/highres_534351875.jpeg"}